| trans_id | trans_type | trans_amount | acc_no |
+----------+------------+--------------+--------+
|        1 | WITHDRAWAL |      3000.00 |      1 |
|        2 | CREDIT     |      3000.00 |      2 |
+----------+------------+--------------+--------+
2 rows in set (0.00 sec)

