Check Balance :
created procedure to check balance :

mysql> DELIMITER $$
mysql> CREATE PROCEDURE checkBalance(In account_no integer)
    -> BEGIN
    -> SELECT balance FROM accounts WHERE acc_no = account_no;
    -> END $$
Query OK, 0 rows affected (0.03 sec)

mysql> DELIMITER ;

Output : 
mysql> CALL checkBalance(3);
+---------+
| balance |
+---------+
|  555.00 |
+---------+
1 row in set (0.01 sec)

